@startuml 007-question-settings-component
title 007 question-settings：組件圖

package "web" {
  [Teacher QuestionList\n每題「雙倍分數」勾選（preparing）] as TList
  [Student QuestionList・AnswerForm\n「雙倍分數」標記] as SList
  [Board・StudentResults\n欄名 score_label] as Board
  [api.ts\nteacherPost(question-settings)] as Api
}

package "server/quiz_server" {
  [app.py\nPOST /api/teacher/question-settings] as App
  [activity.Activity\nattrs・set_question] as Act
  [scoring\nQuestionAttrs・規則乘倍率] as Scoring
  [results\n每題傳入 attrs] as Results
  [views\n每題 multiplier・score_label] as Views
}

TList --> Api
Api --> App : X-Teacher-Key
App --> Act : set_question(number, multiplier)
Results --> Scoring : rank(..., attrs)
Results --> Act : attrs[題號]
Views --> Results
SList ..> Views : 倍率非他組資訊
Board ..> Views
@enduml
